ermira","source_url":"https://www.permira.com/news-and-insights/announcements/duff-phelps-to-be-acquired-by-global-investor-consortium-for-42-billion/","evidence":"Duff & Phelps, the global advisor that protects, restores and maximizes value for clients, today announced that a global investor consortium led by funds managed by Stone Point Capital and Further Global has agreed to acquire Duff & Phelps for $4.2 billion. The equity sellers include the Permira funds, which will continue to hold a significant stake","verified":true},{"key":"pr:bcfff44cd816295ea22f6ff748a78004","date":"2019-12-23","date_text":null,"kind":"secondary","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"P&I","portco_name":"P&I","target_website":"pi-ag.com","investor":"Hg","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"Permira","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":2000000000.0,"currency":"EUR","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Hg Saturn Fund acquires cloud-based HR software provider P&I from Permira funds","summary":"Hg’s Saturn fund acquired a holding in P&I from Permira funds at an enterprise value of €2bn; Permira kept a substantial minority stake.","source_name":"Permira","source_url":"https://www.permira.com/news-and-insights/announcements/hg-saturn-fund-acquires-cloud-based-hr-software-provider-pi-from-permira-funds/","evidence":"Hg, Europe’s leading software investor, today announces an investment in Personal & Informatik AG (“P&I”), a leading provider of cloud-based HR software, headquartered in Germany, acquiring the holding from funds advised by Permira, the global private equity firm, for an enterprise value of €2 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:edf31694ef9902d8842b5d470a494d33","date":"2019-12-04","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Cambrex","portco_name":"Cambrex","target_website":"cambrex.com","investor":"Permira","sponsor_is_investor":true,"spo